        "y0": 0.6643518656465683,
        "x1": 0.7248390815051023,
        "y1": 0.677309733751496
      },
      "text": "to solve image deconvolution problems with Gaussian and Poisson noise.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14285642536377036,
        "y0": 0.7045863393885452,
        "x1": 0.8566698759732356,
        "y1": 0.7175442074934726
      },
      "text": "Main contributions. The main contributions of this paper can be summarized as follows:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.16525613115265414,
        "y0": 0.7287272665012952,
        "x1": 0.3118284508697174,
        "y1": 0.7416851346062227
      },
      "text": "1.We introduce a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
